{"name": "Catfall", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Catfall</strong>, you are the most precious member of a spaceship crew \u2014 a cat whose warmth and gentle purrs bring comfort to everyone on board. Life is perfect\u2026 until a sudden disaster throws everything into chaos. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CHOOSE YOUR CAT </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Of course, you can choose which one you want to play: an orange troublemaker, a calm grey homebody, a white handsome dust collector, or this black ball of fur with green eyes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"502\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325350/extras/c19c0bb92887c5c2c05d7faf499632a2.poster.avif?t=1787051103\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325350/extras/c19c0bb92887c5c2c05d7faf499632a2.webm?t=1787051103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325350/extras/c19c0bb92887c5c2c05d7faf499632a2.mp4?t=1787051103\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SOLVE PUZZLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For a cat, you\u2019re surprisingly good at solving various puzzles. Push a button here, drag a cable there, and suddenly \u2014 the power\u2019s back on! Maybe it\u2019s just feline curiosity at work, but  does it matter if it works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"410\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325350/extras/d79e0535786219422b7fa3dfd7bfd961.poster.avif?t=1787051103\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325350/extras/d79e0535786219422b7fa3dfd7bfd961.webm?t=1787051103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325350/extras/d79e0535786219422b7fa3dfd7bfd961.mp4?t=1787051103\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BE A CAT AND HAVE FUN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t forget to be your adorable feline self \u2014 hunt for snacks, claim the coziest nap spots, and keep your spirits high. After all, your well-being might just be the key to surviving this journey. And remember: naughtiness is always an option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"502\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325350/extras/816b677676385792a2daeabd7b98e9fb.poster.avif?t=1787051103\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325350/extras/816b677676385792a2daeabd7b98e9fb.webm?t=1787051103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325350/extras/816b677676385792a2daeabd7b98e9fb.mp4?t=1787051103\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">OVERCOME DANGERS AND SURVIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fun is fine, but don\u2019t forget the disaster. A kitty probably can\u2019t repair a high-tech starship, but you\u2019ll still be invaluable to your crew. Use your agility and quiet sneaking to help the mission. Most importantly \u2014 keep track of how many lives you have left, and don\u2019t forget to land on your paws!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"502\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325350/extras/4e9d2d6f56c27d6b38c685d910d253db.poster.avif?t=1787051103\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325350/extras/4e9d2d6f56c27d6b38c685d910d253db.webm?t=1787051103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325350/extras/4e9d2d6f56c27d6b38c685d910d253db.mp4?t=1787051103\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Taking a cat on a spaceship? Great idea, as long as everything goes according to plan. It's a short road from fun adventures to sudden problems. And who knows? Maybe now the fate of the entire crew depends on one little fluffy hero... After all, cats always land on their paws, don\u2019t they?", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325350/604ab91be7f312a65d7d1c66695594827f8b30e0/header.jpg?t=1787051103", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Cats", "Adventure", "Atmospheric", "Singleplayer", "Emotional", "Exploration"], "developers": "Eduard Pizhuk", "publishers": "Eduard Pizhuk", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3325350", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "17 August 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/BJ_uqtZJY64", "first_seen": 1786917600.0, "review_rank": 114}